      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not sure if I understood how to replicate this properly, but blendshape based eyelook seemed to work fine with VRCFT (UEv2)?\n\nWhen testing with a private avatar [Comfy Moe Hush_Rush （lilToon）](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_2ffc5f5b-d4c0-4d8a-bd6d-865d6722fa51) (`avtr_2ffc5f5b-d4c0-4d8a-bd6d-865d6722fa51`) by WubTheCaptain (only Eye Look state \"Tracking\" is available):\n\n- Unity 2022.3.22f1 `Build 1864` (live): Eyelook / blink works as intended. (`Moe 2022.3.22f1.mp4`)\n\n- Unity 6000.0.60f1 `Build 1864` (unity-6): Eyelook / blink works as intended. (`Moe 6000.0.60f1.mp4`)\n\nWhen testing with a private avatar [Comfy MoeFT Hush_Rush （lilToon）](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_5d925964-e921-4b24-81a9-f19eef7d3eb1) (`avtr_5d925964-e921-4b24-81a9-f19eef7d3eb1`) by WubTheCaptain:\n\n- Unity 6000.0.60f1 `Build 1864` (unity-6): Eyelook / blink works as intended in both \"Tracking\" and \"Animation\" states (this avatar is meant to disable/freeze eyelook entirely when eyetracking is disabled and state \"Tracking\"). (`Moe EchoFT 6000.0.60f1.mp4`)\n\nWhen testing with [Runa Hash Face Tracking Sample](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_ed0bef22-00e1-488c-9f4b-61f1473ec2c8) (`avtr_ed0bef22-00e1-488c-9f4b-61f1473ec2c8`) by HΛSH, I only have eyetracking when eyetracking FX layers is enabled in expressions:\n\n- Unity 2022.3.22f1 `Build 1864` (live): Eyelook resets immediately when FT is toggled off? Eyelid and mouth blendshapes freeze. (`Runa HashFT 2022.3.22f1.mp4`)\n\n- Unity 6000.0.60f1 `Build 1864` (unity-6): Eyelook resets to 0 after a few seconds of timeout (not 10s) when FT is toggled off and the blendshape appears to freeze in place? Eyelid and mouth blendshapes freeze. (`Runa HashFT 6000.0.60f1.mp4`)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
